","path":"style.css"},{"content":"# Cloud Cargo

Cloud Cargo is an original deterministic cargo-allocation practice puzzle. Each manifest presents a small shared set of cargo crates and several airship bays. A crate has mass and energy; select a crate and assign it to a bay until every bay exactly reaches its shown target. The opening manifest uses mass only, then energy becomes a second simultaneous constraint.

## Play

Press **Start Loading**. Use **Left/Right** to move the selection across crates and bays, then press **Space** to select a crate or assign the selected crate to a bay. On touch devices, tap a crate and then tap a bay. Assignments can always be changed. Complete three manifests before the 50-second shift ends.

The board generator is deterministic for a supplied seed, constructs targets from a valid allocation, and does not reveal that allocation. Replaying a run with the same GameKit seed produces the same manifests. The device-local best shown in the interface is managed only by GameKit.

The game has no account, network service, external assets, audio, or custom persistence. Reduced-motion preference changes are observed while the game is open.
